<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DMG starts media companies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DMG starts media companies.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said Friday analyst Alan Kassan started coverage of four media companies.</p>
<p>-- Started Viacom Inc and Walt Disney Co with accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- Started Seagram Co Ltd and Time Warner Inc with hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Viacom closed Thursday at 30-5/8, Disney closed at 80-3/4 and Time Warner closed at 46-1/2. NYSE-listed shares in Seagram closed at 41.</p>
</text>
